      <td><p>Maximum value for the Beta distribution.</p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>priorParameters</th>
      <td><p>Prior Parameters for the top level base distribution.</p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>hyperPriorParameters</th>
      <td><p>Hyper prior parameters for the top level base distribution.</p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
